	(text "R41/R42 = 22R series source termination on the\nmotor SPI bus (5 drops, 15.625 Mbit/s). Damps\nreflections into the ~50R trace. Place at the MCU\nend of the trace, not near the connectors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 356.87 153.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "257a4d4f-3b80-4d3d-a073-4b8549e121cc")
	)
	(text "DECOUPLING PLACEMENT - the label under each cap names the STM32 pin it must be placed beside at layout.\nAll of these sit on the same +3V3 / GND nets, so the netlist alone cannot preserve this pairing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.69 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "39259a3d-e5fd-479d-8f99-0b74f4f5b6b1")
	)
	(text "I2C PULL-UPS - all four buses pulled up HERE, at the host\n(design review: \"move I2C pull-ups to the main MCU schematic\",\n\"pull-ups live in the MCU\").\nA bus needs exactly one pull-up pair. Keeping them at the host\nmakes that obvious and stops a second pair appearing when someone\nedits a connector sheet.\n   IMU        PF0/PF1     R16/R17  4.7k  on-board, short trace\n   KICKER     PB10/PB11   R30/R31  2.2k  leaves the board on cable\n   EXPANSION  PF14/PF15   R32/R33  2.2k  leaves the board on cable\n   OLED       PB8/PB9     R34/R35  3k    per the design doc\nWhy 2.2k on the cabled buses: I2C Fast Mode allows 300 ns rise.\n   t_r ~ 0.85 x R x C.  At 4.7k into just 100 pF that is ~400 ns -\n   already over budget before any cable is attached. 2.2k into\n   200 pF gives ~370 ns... still marginal, so if the kicker or\n   expansion cables run long, drop to 1.5k and re-check.\nSink current at 2.2k is 3.3/2200 = 1.5 mA, well inside the 3 mA\nan I2C device must sink."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 396.24 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4b243b3f-6c17-472e-8adb-192e51405af7")
	)
	(text "VDD33USB p95 (C24+C25)\nUSB FS PHY - keep both close"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify top)
